==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[page]] in a book (e.g., a [[scrapbook]]) where one can write down special [[memory|memories]] and insert [[memento]]es.
# A page in an annual publication (e.g., a high-school [[yearbook]]) honoring the [[memory]] of a person who [[die]]d during the past year. It may contain photographs, life dates, and writings such as [[verse]].
#: {{ux|en|The yearbook had a nice '''memory page''' for the teenaged girl who died in a car accident this past winter.}}
# {{senseid|en|virtual memory}} {{lb|en|computing}} A fixed-length contiguous block of [[virtual memory#Noun|virtual memory]], representing the smallest division of a [[page table#Noun|page table]].

